{
  "info": {
    "name": "FSMS - Feature 8 - Service Request List, Detail, Cancel",
    "description": "Feature 8 tests: GET /service-requests, GET /service-requests/:id, DELETE /service-requests/:id.\n\nAuth requests are intentionally NOT included. Set these collection variables before running:\n- baseUrl (default http://localhost:5000)\n- customerToken, technicianToken, managerToken, adminToken (raw JWT values, no 'Bearer ' prefix)\n- serviceId (an active service id, used only by the optional setup requests)\n- otherCustomerRequestId (a request owned by a different customer)\n- assignedRequestId (a request whose work order is ASSIGNED/SCHEDULED or later)\n\nRun the Setup folder first. It creates fresh PENDING_REVIEW requests and stores their ids automatically. Then run List -> Detail -> Cancel -> Verify in order.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:5000" },
    { "key": "customerToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "technicianToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "managerToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "adminToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "serviceId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "requestId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "cancelRequestId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "cancelRequestIdWithReason", "value": "" },
    { "key": "managerCancelRequestId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "otherCustomerRequestId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "assignedRequestId", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Setup (optional - run first)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create request (for list/detail/cancel no reason)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{customerToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "serviceId", "value": "{{serviceId}}", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "description", "value": "Feature 8 setup request - cancel without reason", "type": "text" }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/service-requests",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "service-requests"]
            },
            "description": "Uses the existing Feature 7 create endpoint. Stores requestId and cancelRequestId."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('success is true', () => pm.expect(json.success).to.eql(true));",
                  "if (json && json.data && json.data.id) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('requestId', json.data.id);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('cancelRequestId', json.data.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Create request (for cancel with reason)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{customerToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "serviceId", "value": "{{serviceId}}", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "description", "value": "Feature 8 setup request - cancel with reason", "type": "text" }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/service-requests",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "service-requests"]
            },
            "description": "Uses the existing Feature 7 create endpoint. Stores cancelRequestIdWithReason."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json && json.data && json.data.id) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('cancelRequestIdWithReason', json.data.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Create request (for manager cancel)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{customerToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "serviceId", "value": "{{serviceId}}", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "description", "value": "Feature 8 setup request - manager cancel", "type": "text" }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/service-requests",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "service-requests"]
